{"seq":2,"slug":"embedded-c-and-rust","title":"嵌入式 C 与 Rust 开发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/embedded-systems-iot/embedded-fundamentals/embedded-c-and-rust","wordCount":943,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"嵌入式-c-与-rust-开发\">嵌入式 C 与 Rust 开发</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>嵌入式系统开发对编程语言有特殊要求：零成本抽象、确定性内存管理、直接硬件访问和可预测的执行时间。C 语言凭借其接近硬件的特性统治嵌入式领域数十年，而 Rust 作为新兴的系统级语言，通过所有权系统在编译期消除内存安全问题，正在成为嵌入式开发的有力替代选择。理解两者在嵌入式场景下的编程范式和工具链差异，有助于为项目做出正确的技术选型。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[嵌入式编程语言] --&gt; B[C 语言]&#10;    A --&gt; C[Rust 语言]&#10;    B --&gt; D[直接硬件访问]&#10;    B --&gt; E[成熟工具链]&#10;    B --&gt; F[运行时开销为零]&#10;    C --&gt; G[所有权与借用检查]&#10;    C --&gt; H[零成本抽象]&#10;    C --&gt; I[编译期内存安全]&#10;    D --&gt; J[寄存器操作]&#10;    G --&gt; K[无数据竞争]\">graph TD\n    A[嵌入式编程语言] --&gt; B[C 语言]\n    A --&gt; C[Rust 语言]\n    B --&gt; D[直接硬件访问]\n    B --&gt; E[成熟工具链]\n    B --&gt; F[运行时开销为零]\n    C --&gt; G[所有权与借用检查]\n    C --&gt; H[零成本抽象]\n    C --&gt; I[编译期内存安全]\n    D --&gt; J[寄存器操作]\n    G --&gt; K[无数据竞争]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>C</th>\n<th>Rust</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>内存安全</td>\n<td>手动管理，易出错</td>\n<td>编译器保证</td>\n<td>Rust 杜绝悬垂指针和缓冲区溢出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并发安全</td>\n<td>手动同步</td>\n<td>Send/Sync 编译检查</td>\n<td>Rust 编译期阻止数据竞争</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>零成本抽象</td>\n<td>宏 + 函数指针</td>\n<td>trait + 泛型</td>\n<td>Rust 抽象无运行时开销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生态成熟度</td>\n<td>极成熟（50年）</td>\n<td>快速增长</td>\n<td>C 的 HAL/BSP 库更丰富</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工具链</td>\n<td>GCC/Clang + Make/CMake</td>\n<td>cargo + probe-rs</td>\n<td>Rust 工具链更现代</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>学习曲线</td>\n<td>中（指针难点）</td>\n<td>高（所有权系统）</td>\n<td>Rust 前期投入更大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标准库</td>\n<td>libc（可选）</td>\n<td>no_std + alloc（可选）</td>\n<td>两者都支持无标准库</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"嵌入式-c-编程模式\">嵌入式 C 编程模式</h2><h3 id=\"寄存器抽象层\">寄存器抽象层</h3><p>嵌入式 C 的核心是通过 volatile 指针访问内存映射的外设寄存器：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"typedef struct {&#10;    volatile uint32_t MODER;&#10;    volatile uint32_t OTYPER;&#10;    volatile uint32_t OSPEEDR;&#10;    volatile uint32_t PUPDR;&#10;    volatile uint32_t IDR;&#10;    volatile uint32_t ODR;&#10;    volatile uint32_t BSRR;&#10;    volatile uint32_t LCKR;&#10;    volatile uint32_t AFR[2];&#10;} GPIO_TypeDef;&#10;&#10;#define GPIOA ((GPIO_TypeDef *)0x40020000)&#10;&#10;void led_toggle(void) {&#10;    GPIOA-&gt;ODR ^= (1 &lt;&lt; 5);&#10;}&#10;&#10;void led_on(void) {&#10;    GPIOA-&gt;BSRR = (1 &lt;&lt; 5);&#10;}&#10;&#10;void led_off(void) {&#10;    GPIOA-&gt;BSRR = (1 &lt;&lt; (5 + 16));&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">typedef</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    volatile</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> uint32_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MODER;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    volatile</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> uint32_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OTYPER;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    volatile</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> uint32_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OSPEEDR;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    volatile</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> uint32_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> PUPDR;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    volatile</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> uint32_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> IDR;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    volatile</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> uint32_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ODR;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    volatile</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> uint32_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> BSRR;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    volatile</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> uint32_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> LCKR;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    volatile</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> uint32_t</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> AFR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} GPIO_TypeDef;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#define</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> GPIOA</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ((GPIO_TypeDef </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">0x</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">40020000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<sp